<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 7859 0 R/Alt(Sketch of the pressure p/p_max, in red, and of the density rho/rho_max, in black, against r/r_sh. The pressure is constant in the hot bubble that fills the interior and drops at the shell. The density is low in the interior and rises to a narrow peak, the cold shell, just inside r/r_sh = 1, which moves outwards at speed v_shell, about U_sh. Outside the shell the density is that of the ISM.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[156]/Pg 18860 0 R>>
